1
00:00:17,930 --> 00:00:23,760
The Lord’s my light, his strength is near

2
00:00:23,760 --> 00:00:27,940
Why should I tremble? Why should I fear?

3
00:00:28,830 --> 00:00:33,540
When shadows fall and my hopes are gone

4
00:00:33,540 --> 00:00:38,686
His love remains, God keeps me strong

5
00:00:38,686 --> 00:00:43,120
Though walls may rise and doors seem closed

6
00:00:43,120 --> 00:00:48,260
He hides me safe where no one knows

7
00:00:48,260 --> 00:00:52,480
Under His shelter, I feel secure

8
00:00:53,190 --> 00:00:58,200
His love protects me forever sure

9
00:00:58,200 --> 00:01:03,040
Wait for the Lord, His peace will last

10
00:01:03,040 --> 00:01:07,700
His steady hand will hold you fast

11
00:01:07,700 --> 00:01:12,880
When hope feels lost and night is near

12
00:01:12,880 --> 00:01:17,453
His shining light will calm your fear

13
00:01:22,050 --> 00:01:27,600
Even in darkness, I will not hide

14
00:01:27,600 --> 00:01:32,500
For He's my fortress, my steady guide

15
00:01:32,500 --> 00:01:37,180
When all I trusted falls away

16
00:01:37,180 --> 00:01:42,380
His faithful love will always stay

17
00:01:42,380 --> 00:01:47,360
One thing I ask, to be in His house

18
00:01:47,360 --> 00:01:52,420
To seek His face, to quiet my doubts

19
00:01:52,420 --> 00:01:57,420
For in His courts, I’ll find my peace

20
00:01:57,420 --> 00:02:02,380
His light and love will never cease

21
00:02:02,380 --> 00:02:07,400
Wait for the Lord, His peace will last

22
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:12,140
His steady hand will hold you fast

23
00:02:12,140 --> 00:02:17,200
When hope feels lost and night is near

24
00:02:17,200 --> 00:02:23,720
His shining light will calm your fear

25
00:02:25,990 --> 00:02:31,600
The Lord is my light, I will not fear

26
00:02:31,600 --> 00:02:39,424
His love surrounds me, He’s always near
